infinite-patch 1
# 2D compositing: a ramp and a star blended, through a blur-style effect chain, into Output.
node 1 Source Ramp
  id ramp
  f angle 90
end
node 2 Source Shape
  id star
  i shapeType Star
  f sizeX 0.5
end
node 3 Utility Output
  id out
end
node 4 Compositing Blend
  id blend
end
cable blend 0 ramp
cable blend 1 star
cable out 0 blend
